# ==============================================================================
# Cursor Ignore File (.cursorignore)
# Excludes noisy and sensitive files from Cursor AI indexing
# ==============================================================================

# Secrets
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets.json

# Dependencies & Builds
**/node_modules/**
**/vendor/**
**/.venv/**
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/target/**

# Logs & Locks
**/*.log
**/*.lock
**/package-lock.json
**/Cargo.lock
**/coverage/**
